<h2 id="flags" style="color:#1565c0;font-size:1.22em;font-weight:650;border-left:4px solid #42a5f5;padding-left:10px;margin-top:1.1em">3. Flags cheat sheet</h2>

| Flag | Effect |
| --- | --- |
| `--skip-emit` / `--emit none` | Apply + diff only (manifest already in git) |
| `--emit full` | Run full `build_all.sh` before apply |
| `--bootstrap-prerequisites` | Curated promotes before digest (cold DB) |
| `--no-ensure-stack` | Skip tier ensure; fail if API down (legacy) |
| `--ephemeral` | Stop API on exit when this run cold-started that tier |
| `--diff-only` | No emit/apply — tier diff ritual only |
| `--apply-only` | Emit + apply; skip diff |
| `--dry-run` | Plan apply; no DB writes |

**SoT:** `config/seeds/catalog-23-pools.json` — all *-E tiers should match after a successful **psync**.
